              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 1:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca agenda i Nayoti i Rama; maze Mpwemu w’Imana amuzako na we, agenda aravugishwa kurinda ashika i Nayoti i Rama nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashitseyo yīkiza impuzu ziwe, avugishirizwa imbere ya Samweli arambaraye hasi yambaye ubusa, yiriza umusi akēsha ijoro. Ni co catumye bavuga, bati Mbega Sauli na we yari mu bavugishwa n’Imana?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.24"
            ]
